
 Load-store SASS instructions are per thread instructions (as are all SASS instructions)

 STG.E.S32 [R4+0x8], R7

 "E" is a modifier telling you to evict from cache (aka streaming)
 .S32 is the size and type of the data

 Other modifiers include:
  "U" and "C"
  U means cache in 
Cache in L1/L2 (LU, LC): Use when data will be accessed again shortly, and caching can improve performance.

     